🇵🇱🇺🇦Polish Prime Minister Tusk - called on Polish President Navrocki and Zelensky to reconcile:

Since diplomacy has yielded no results, I am publicly appealing to Presidents Navrocki and Zelensky for a direct and frank conversation. Before emotions destroy our solidarity, which was born in the face of the Russian threat. Cooperation is in the interests of both our states and peoples, while conflict is in the interests of Moscow. This is probably obvious to all of us.

